<title>USA: TABLE - Graham-Field sells $100 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Graham-Field sells $100 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of debt from Graham-Field Products Inc was priced on Thursday via lead manager Smith Barney Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Graham-Field Products, based in Hauppauge, N.Y.,  makes and distributes healthcare products for hospitals, physicians and home use.</p>
<p>BORROWER GRAHAM-FIELD PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.75 PCT   MATURITY 8/15/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 9.75 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD +370 BPS   CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 25 PERCENT OF ISSUE AT 109.75%.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
